      "node_id": "kg_doc_18",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Betty (Jean) Eadie (born 1942) is a prominent American author of several books on near-death experiences (NDEs). Her best-known book is the No. 1 New York Times bestselling book \"Embraced by the Light,\" (1992) describing her near-death experience. It was followed by \"The Awakening Heart\" (1996), which was also a best-seller. \"The Ripple Effect\" (1999) and \"Embraced by the Light: Prayers and Devotions for Daily Living\" (2001) were both published independently.",
